      "No matching files.": "No matching files.",
      "No notifications yet.": "No notifications yet.",
      "No problems detected yet. Diagnostics will appear here after a language server or task runs.": "\uC544\uC9C1 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB41C \uBB38\uC81C\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. language server \uB610\uB294 task\uAC00 \uC2E4\uD589\uB41C \uD6C4 diagnostics\uAC00 \uC5EC\uAE30\uC5D0 \uD45C\uC2DC\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.",
      "No projects found": "No projects found",
      "No provider has an API key yet. Add one in AI Models.": "API \uD0A4\uAC00 \uC788\uB294 \uACF5\uAE09\uC790\uAC00 \uC544\uC9C1 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. AI Models\uC5D0\uC11C \uCD94\uAC00\uD558\uC138\uC694.",
      "No requests yet. Send a message in the AI panel, then come back here.": "\uC694\uCCAD\uC774 \uC544\uC9C1 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. AI panel\uC5D0\uC11C \uBA54\uC2DC\uC9C0\uB97C \uBCF4\uB0B8 \uB4A4 \uC5EC\uAE30\uB85C \uB3CC\uC544\uC624\uC138\uC694.",
      "No session yet.": "No session yet.",
      "No subagents yet.": "No subagents yet.",
      "No symbols found.": "No symbols found.",
      "No symbols.": "No symbols.",
      "No terminals open": "No terminals open",
