      "Port forwarding": "Port forwarding",
      "Port must be a number from 1 to 65535": "port\uB294 1\uC5D0\uC11C 65535 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758 \uC22B\uC790\uC5EC\uC57C \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4",
      "Port number to forward": "Port number to forward",
      "Press a combination\u2026": "Press a combination\u2026",
      "Previous (Shift+Enter)": "Previous (Shift+Enter)",
      "Program is running - not paused.": "\uD504\uB85C\uADF8\uB7A8\uC774 \uC2E4\uD589 \uC911\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4 - \uC77C\uC2DC\uC815\uC9C0 \uC544\uB2D8.",
      "Projects": "Projects",
      "Query": "Query",
      "Quick test": "Quick test",
      "RAM saver mode is on: minimap/sticky/indent/color decorators off, loaded tab limit 3, terminal scrollback 1000 lines": "RAM saver mode\uAC00 \uCF1C\uC838 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4: minimap/sticky/indent/color decorators \uB054, \uB85C\uB4DC tab \uC81C\uD55C 3, terminal scrollback 1000\uC904",
      "Re-run the test file when it is saved": "\uC800\uC7A5\uD560 \uB54C \uD14C\uC2A4\uD2B8 \uD30C\uC77C \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2E4\uD589",
      "Read only. Pick at least one.": "\uC77D\uAE30 \uC804\uC6A9. \uCD5C\uC18C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uC120\uD0DD\uD558\uC138\uC694.",
      "Record AI requests": "Record AI requests",
