      "skipped": "skipped",
      "smooth scroll off, minimap/sticky/indent/color decorators off, loaded tab limit 3 (of 12), terminal scrollback 1000 lines": "smooth scroll \uB054, minimap/sticky/indent/color decorators \uB054, \uB85C\uB4DC tab \uC81C\uD55C 3 (12 \uC911), terminal scrollback 1000\uC904",
      "smoother, slightly heavier": "\uB354 \uBD80\uB4DC\uB7FD\uC9C0\uB9CC \uC57D\uAC04 \uBB34\uAC70\uC6C0",
      "steps are collapsed right after they finish": "\uB2E8\uACC4\uB294 \uB05D\uB09C \uC9C1\uD6C4 \uC811\uD799\uB2C8\uB2E4",
      "stopped": "stopped",
      "swatch for #hex/rgb()/hsl(), click for a picker": "#hex/rgb()/hsl() \uACAC\uBCF8. \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uBA74 \uD53C\uCEE4",
