      "yes": "yes",
      "\u22483.0k tokens for the full tool list": "\uC804\uCCB4 tool \uBAA9\uB85D\uC5D0 \uC57D 3.0k tokens",
      "Detecting...": "Detecting...",
      "Re-detect": "Re-detect",
      "Debug Console. Start a debug session (F5), then evaluate an expression in the frame that is paused.": "Debug Console. Start a debug session (F5), then evaluate an expression in the frame that is paused.",
      "Thought briefly": "\uC7A0\uC2DC \uC0DD\uAC01\uD568",
