      "No projects found": "No projects found",
      "No provider has an API key yet. Add one in AI Models.": "\u8FD8\u6CA1\u6709\u4EFB\u4F55\u63D0\u4F9B\u5546\u6709 API \u5BC6\u94A5\u3002\u8BF7\u5728 AI Models \u4E2D\u6DFB\u52A0\u3002",
      "No requests yet. Send a message in the AI panel, then come back here.": "\u5C1A\u65E0\u8BF7\u6C42\u3002\u5728 AI panel \u4E2D\u53D1\u9001\u4E00\u6761\u6D88\u606F\uFF0C\u7136\u540E\u56DE\u5230\u8FD9\u91CC\u3002",
      "No session yet.": "No session yet.",
      "No subagents yet.": "No subagents yet.",
      "No symbols found.": "No symbols found.",
      "No symbols.": "No symbols.",
