      "One line \u2014 the AI reads it to decide when to delegate here": "\u4E00\u884C \u2014 AI \u4F1A\u9605\u8BFB\u5B83\u6765\u51B3\u5B9A\u4F55\u65F6\u59D4\u6D3E\u5230\u8FD9\u91CC",
      "Open": "Open",
      "Open File": "Open File",
      "Open Folder": "Open Folder",
