      "Stop forward": "Stop forward",
      "Stop the server after idle (seconds)": "\u7A7A\u95F2\u540E\u505C\u6B62 server (\u79D2)",
      "Stop the current run, then send this": "\u505C\u6B62\u5F53\u524D\u8FD0\u884C\uFF0C\u7136\u540E\u53D1\u9001\u8FD9\u6761",
      "Stop the current run and keep this typed": "\u505C\u6B62\u5F53\u524D\u8FD0\u884C\uFF0C\u4FDD\u7559\u8FD9\u6BB5\u8F93\u5165",
      "Strength": "Strength",
      "Subagent info to the right of chat": "subagent \u4FE1\u606F\u663E\u793A\u5728 chat \u53F3\u4FA7",
      "Subagent: close": "Subagent: close",
      "Subagent: delete": "Subagent: delete",
      "Subagent: edit": "Subagent: edit",
      "Subagent: save": "Subagent: save",
      'Subagents are invoked by the main agent through the "Parallel tasks" button in the AI panel, or automatically when a task can be split up.': 'subagent \u7531\u4E3B agent \u901A\u8FC7 AI panel \u4E2D\u7684 "Parallel tasks" \u6309\u94AE\u8C03\u7528\uFF0C\u6216\u5728\u4EFB\u52A1\u53EF\u62C6\u5206\u65F6\u81EA\u52A8\u8C03\u7528\u3002',
      "Subagents are standalone - run from here, separate from the AI conversation. Their results do not go into the chat history.": "subagent \u662F\u72EC\u7ACB\u7684 - \u4ECE\u8FD9\u91CC\u8FD0\u884C\uFF0C\u4E0E AI \u5BF9\u8BDD\u5206\u79BB\u3002\u5B83\u4EEC\u7684\u7ED3\u679C\u4E0D\u4F1A\u8FDB\u5165 chat \u5386\u53F2\u3002",
