      "External AI CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, opencode, Copilot CLI, Cursor) can read panes, editor tabs, and settings - and also drive this window: type in the terminal, open files, run commands. Loopback only: never exposed to the network.": "External AI CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, opencode, Copilot CLI, Cursor) can read panes, editor tabs, and settings - and also drive this window: type in the terminal, open files, run commands. Loopback only: never exposed to the network.",
      "of": "de",
      "in encrypted form (key derived from this machine), SEPARATE from settings.json. The frontend only receives a mask - the real key is never sent to the UI and never logged. Honest note: this encryption protects against someone reading the file, not against someone who already has access to your Windows account.": "in encrypted form (key derived from this machine), SEPARATE from settings.json. The frontend only receives a mask - the real key is never sent to the UI and never logged. Honest note: this encryption protects against someone reading the file, not against someone who already has access to your Windows account.",
