      "The write setting is on, but the AI approval mode is not Auto, so a file write is still refused - a subagent cannot ask for approval itself.": "El ajuste de escritura est\xE1 activado, pero el modo de aprobaci\xF3n de la IA no es Auto, as\xED que la escritura sigue rechaz\xE1ndose: un subagente no puede pedir aprobaci\xF3n por s\xED mismo.",
      "{n} write attempts were refused by the write gate": "El portero de escritura rechaz\xF3 {n} intentos de escritura",
