      "When this switch is on, Zephyr becomes an MCP server at": "Quand ce commutateur est activ\xE9, Zephyr devient un serveur MCP sur",
      "Where runtimes, projects, databases, certificates, and logs live.": "O\xF9 se trouvent les runtimes, les projets, les bases de donn\xE9es, les certificats et les logs.",
