      "Your own read-only worker. The AI can delegate to an active one by name, using the built-in roles (Search, Review, Plan, Audit, Work, Explore).": "Seu pr\xF3prio worker somente leitura. A IA pode delegar a um ativo pelo nome, usando os pap\xE9is integrados (Search, Review, Plan, Audit, Work, Explore).",
