      "Zephyr does NOT bundle language server binaries (the installer stays ~7 MB). Servers are looked up in": "O Zephyr N\xC3O inclui os bin\xE1rios dos language servers (o instalador continua em ~7 MB). Os servidores s\xE3o procurados em",
