      "Rollback": "Reverter",
      "External AI CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, opencode, Copilot CLI, Cursor) can read panes, editor tabs, and settings - and also drive this window: type in the terminal, open files, run commands. Loopback only: never exposed to the network.": "External AI CLIs (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, opencode, Copilot CLI, Cursor) can read panes, editor tabs, and settings - and also drive this window: type in the terminal, open files, run commands. Loopback only: never exposed to the network.",
      "of": "de",
      "in encrypted form (key derived from this machine), SEPARATE from settings.json. The frontend only receives a mask - the real key is never sent to the UI and never logged. Honest note: this encryption protects against someone reading the file, not against someone who already has access to your Windows account.": "in encrypted form (key derived from this machine), SEPARATE from settings.json. The frontend only receives a mask - the real key is never sent to the UI and never logged. Honest note: this encryption protects against someone reading the file, not against someone who already has access to your Windows account.",
      "Name": "Nome",
      "IntelliSense is off. Turn it on above to change the servers below.": "O IntelliSense est\xE1 desativado. Ative-o acima para alterar os servidores abaixo.",
      "Installed on this machine": "Instalado nesta m\xE1quina",
      "Install the language server": "Instalar o language server",
      "language server": "language server",
      "Zephyr could not find": "O Zephyr n\xE3o encontrou",
      "on your PATH. Install it, then check again to enable this server.": "no seu PATH. Instale-o e verifique novamente para ativar este servidor.",
      "Found it. Switch this server on to use it.": "Encontrado. Ative este servidor para us\xE1-lo.",
      "Checking...": "Verificando...",
      "Check again": "Verificar novamente",
      "Use agent": "Usar este agente",
      "agents.chatAvatar": "Avatares no chat",
      "the robot and your photo beside each message": "o rob\xF4 e a sua foto ao lado de cada mensagem",
      "Own endpoint for speech, e.g. a local TTS server. Empty means the chat provider address.": "Endpoint pr\xF3prio para voz, ex. um servidor TTS local. Vazio = endere\xE7o do provedor de chat.",
      "Saved like a chat key. Empty means use the provider key above. Local servers usually need no key.": "Salva como uma chave de chat. Vazio = usar a chave do provedor. Servidores locais geralmente n\xE3o precisam de chave.",
      "Ollama runs on this machine and needs no key. Leave the field empty.": "Ollama roda nesta m\xE1quina e n\xE3o precisa de chave. Deixe vazio.",
      "No key needed (local)": "Sem chave (local)",
      "Mic server URL": "URL do servidor de microfone",
      "Mic model": "Modelo do microfone",
      "Transcription model on that server. Typed by hand. Empty means the provider default.": "Modelo de transcri\xE7\xE3o nesse servidor. Digitado \xE0 m\xE3o. Vazio usa o padr\xE3o do provedor.",
      "Read-only: subagents cannot write files.": "Somente leitura: subagentes n\xE3o podem escrever arquivos.",
      "Subagents can write files while the approval mode is Auto.": "Subagentes podem escrever arquivos enquanto o modo de aprova\xE7\xE3o for Auto.",
      "The write setting is on, but the AI approval mode is not Auto, so a file write is still refused - a subagent cannot ask for approval itself.": "A configura\xE7\xE3o de escrita est\xE1 ligada, mas o modo de aprova\xE7\xE3o da IA n\xE3o \xE9 Auto, ent\xE3o a escrita continua sendo recusada - um subagente n\xE3o pode pedir aprova\xE7\xE3o sozinho.",
      "{n} write attempts were refused by the write gate": "O port\xE3o de escrita recusou {n} tentativas de escrita",
      "A subagent cannot ask for approval, so a file write also needs the approval mode Auto - without it the write is refused and reported as a refusal, not as a written file.": "Um subagente n\xE3o pode pedir aprova\xE7\xE3o, ent\xE3o escrever um arquivo tamb\xE9m exige o modo de aprova\xE7\xE3o Auto - sem ele a escrita \xE9 recusada e relatada como recusa, n\xE3o como arquivo escrito.",
      "Write permission now": "Permiss\xE3o de escrita agora",
      "Off. Subagent write attempts are refused and reported back: no file is changed.": "Desligado. As tentativas de escrita do subagente s\xE3o recusadas e relatadas: nenhum arquivo \xE9 alterado.",
